onate towards her friends.\n- Tri is usually quiet and reserved, but around those they feel close with, they are more open and can be silly! They also have slight symptoms of jakigan kei chuunibyou.\n\nRelationship: They are best friends who are very fond of each other!\n\nPlease draw them in the \"Matchy Outfits' in the reference link (first image)! Can I request them on a playdate? It can be them shopping, playing games, hanging in a blanket fort, baking desserts, eating desserts,  taking a stroll, or making flower crowns! If sensei has another idea, feel free to draw that instead!!! \n\nFeel free to appeal or cancel if not appropriate. Thank you!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/2e5040iqgtd?edit=1", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@zuwaineko/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 48654, "client_id": 1188369, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a795b0b/uploads/origins/b0dfe0a2-a0b5-4d79-96fc-34727e24c4da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06e9f3355b407b04c14621e152e945dd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3a795b0b/uploads/origins/b0dfe0a2-a0b5-4d79-96fc-34727e24c4da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06e9f3355b407b04c14621e152e945dd, https://si.imgix.net/3a795b0b/uploads/origins/b0dfe0a2-a0b5-4d79-96fc-34727e24c4da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e83fb33bec9b9ced88fdf53846c8fbdd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3a795b0b/uploads/origins/b0dfe0a2-a0b5-4d79-96fc-34727e24c4da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3433e62a4ad708ca28c036cac18d16a7 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3a795b0b/uploads/origins/b0dfe0a2-a0b5-4d79-96fc-34727e24c4da?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccomp